/C [ 0 0 0 ] /Contents (9:25\20510:00\012\012The takeaway is a process you can repeat: observe, evaluate, identify, and act. Keep the benefit you value, try one realistic change, and review what actually happened. The worksheet has the same four steps. Scan the QR or use the address for the activity and resources. The presentation link will keep working when the activity returns to the portfolio. Thank you.\012\012Presenter cue: Show the worksheet and QR. End by 10:00. Do not imply an automatic retirement date.\012\012) /QuadPoints [ 1234 12 1254 12 1234 32 1254 32 ] /Rect [ 1234 12 1254 32 ] /Subtype /Text /Type /Annot
